 \, and judges to deliver a timely\, in-depth\, results-oriented look at th
 e latest developments in patent law and practice. \nAttend the programming
  that matters most to your practice area. As in previous years\, our agend
 a will be presented over two days\, with Day 2 organized in our very popul
 ar\,\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://law.stanford.edu/event/27th-annual
 -berkeley-stanford-advanced-patent-law-institute/\nLast synced: 2026-11-19
